arrative-dissonances-and-other-old-lore-incoherences-in-the-wod?p=1489088#post1489088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's the Alexandrian's 2019 post on the <a href=\"https://thealexandrian.net/wordpress/43510/roleplaying-games/game-structures-addendum-katanas-trenchcoats\" target=\"_blank\">Katanas &amp; Trenchcoats style of play.</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Thanks! Sometimes it's hell to find what you're searching in your saved pages","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T16:43:52-07:00","id":1491959,"title":"","content":"Another buggy thing is the fact that the generations design makes the masquerade almost imposible due overpopulation<ul><li>For the 13th generation to exist you need at least 12 extra vampires as ancestors, yeah some might be dead or in torpor but if you take into account that higher gens are an opressed &quot;majority&quot; things gets worse.</li> <li>For each 3rd gen there is a bunch of 4th gens and for each one of them there is another bunch of 5th gens making the population explode after ten generation.</li> <li>The embrace having no cost just makes things worse as one leech can potentially break the masquerade.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> Also most vampires are unable to feed properly because <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Without animalism animals hate you</li> <li>The kiss just gives pleasure but does not erases memories, this is one of the most handwaved things by ST becuase if you don\u00b4t do it then the setting does not make sense.</li> <li>Take in account that vampires have to feed multiple times a month and then you get an absurd amount of withness and bodies that break the masquerade.</li> </ol><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24037-leandro16","name":"Leandro16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24037_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}